  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Central Asia Green Inclusive Growth (GIG) Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK-Central Asia Green Inclusive Growth (GIG) Fund will harness UK&#x2019;s convening power by establishing a platform for future increased green investment into Central Asia, combining UK&#x2019;s diplomatic, development and commercial levers. GIG will build on UK&#x2019;s extensive expertise in establishing private equity/venture capital (PE/VC) funds for development worldwide. By working closely with IFIs and developing local institutions, GIG will invest in targeted business advisory support and offer green growth finance to those firms with the highest potential.</narrative>
  </description>
